{
  "format": 1,
  "name": "lot_developer_foundation_lookup",
  "spec": ["lot-developer 17.5.1", "lot-developer 17.5.2", "lot-developer 16"],
  "description": "Test 34 (§17.5.1, §17.5.2). A lot foundation (kind 2, occupant type 0x68FD0C69) whose box covers x in [100, 132], z in [100, 132], on cells (6, 6, 7, 7) under lot 1. Slot 50 GetFoundationByPosition(kind, x, z) queries occupant manager slot 37 with min = (x - 0.05, -FLT_MAX, z + 0.05), max = (x - 0.05, +FLT_MAX, z + 0.05): a vertical line, not a square [quirk]. (2, 100.04, 120) -> null (the line is at x = 99.99); (2, 131.9, 99.96) -> found (line at (131.85, 100.01)) [inferred, LD-Q9: the occupant manager keeps an occupant whose box meets the closed query box]; x = 100.06 -> found (100.01); x = 132.04 -> found (131.99), 132.06 -> null; z = 131.94 -> found (131.99), 131.96 -> null. A kind that differs gives null. The result carries no reference (the scripted world does not count references; the plugin's ctest checks the count). Slot 49 GetFoundationByStandardCityCell(2, x, z) uses the cell list (slot 41); slot 51 GetLotFoundation(lot) is slot 49 on the lot's location. Slot 48 GetFoundationByOccupant(occ): kind 1 for a building, 3 for a prop, 4 for any other type, then slot 50 at the occupant's position. Slot 52 RemoveFoundation(2, x, z) removes the found occupant (RemoveOccupant(o, 1, 0)), AL = 1, and clears the flags bits 0-1 of the lot on cell (trunc(x / 16), trunc(z / 16)) whether or not a foundation was found (AL = 0). Slot 53 RemoveLotFoundation(x, z) does the same by cell. Slot 60 RemoveBuildingFoundation(b) is slot 52(1, position x, position z).",
  "steps": [
    {"op": "ldev_terrain", "flat": 100},
    {"op": "ldev_lot", "id": 1, "x": 6, "z": 6, "w": 2, "h": 2, "state": 3, "flags": 3},
    {"op": "ldev_occ", "id": 70, "foundation_kind": 2, "foundation_type": "0x890B7312", "cells": [6, 6, 7, 7],
      "bbox": [[100, 90, 100], [132, 110, 132]], "position": [116, 100, 116]},
    {"op": "ldev_create", "seed": 12345},
    {"op": "ldev_init", "expect": true},
    {"op": "ldev_clear_events"},

    {"op": "ldev_foundation", "position": [100.04, 120], "kind": 2, "expect": null, "note": "line at x = 99.99"},
    {"op": "ldev_foundation", "position": [131.9, 99.96], "kind": 2, "expect": 70, "note": "line at (131.85, 100.01)"},
    {"op": "ldev_foundation", "position": [100.06, 120], "kind": 2, "expect": 70},
    {"op": "ldev_foundation", "position": [132.04, 120], "kind": 2, "expect": 70},
    {"op": "ldev_foundation", "position": [132.06, 120], "kind": 2, "expect": null},
    {"op": "ldev_foundation", "position": [120, 131.94], "kind": 2, "expect": 70},
    {"op": "ldev_foundation", "position": [120, 131.96], "kind": 2, "expect": null},
    {"op": "ldev_foundation", "position": [120, 99.94], "kind": 2, "expect": null, "note": "line at z = 99.99"},
    {"op": "ldev_foundation", "position": [120, 120], "kind": 1, "expect": null, "note": "another kind"},
    {"op": "ldev_foundation", "cell": [6, 6], "kind": 2, "expect": 70},
    {"op": "ldev_foundation", "cell": [7, 7], "kind": 2, "expect": 70},
    {"op": "ldev_foundation", "cell": [8, 7], "kind": 2, "expect": null},
    {"op": "ldev_foundation", "cell": [6, 6], "kind": 3, "expect": null},
    {"op": "ldev_foundation", "lot": 1, "expect": 70},
    {"op": "ldev_expect_events", "events": [], "note": "lookups write nothing"},

    {"op": "ldev_occ", "id": 71, "foundation_kind": 1, "cells": [2, 2, 2, 2], "bbox": [[34, 90, 34], [46, 110, 46]]},
    {"op": "ldev_occ", "id": 72, "foundation_kind": 3, "cells": [2, 2, 2, 2], "bbox": [[34, 90, 34], [46, 110, 46]]},
    {"op": "ldev_occ", "id": 73, "foundation_kind": 4, "cells": [2, 2, 2, 2], "bbox": [[34, 90, 34], [46, 110, 46]]},
    {"op": "ldev_occ", "id": 80, "is_building": true, "position": [40, 100, 40], "cells": [2, 2, 2, 2], "bbox": [[36, 100, 36], [44, 120, 44]]},
    {"op": "ldev_occ", "id": 81, "position": [40, 100, 40], "cells": [2, 2, 2, 2], "bbox": [[39, 100, 39], [41, 104, 41]],
      "note": "a prop (no type, not a building)"},
    {"op": "ldev_occ", "id": 82, "type": "0x12345678", "position": [40, 100, 40], "cells": [2, 2, 2, 2], "bbox": [[39, 100, 39], [41, 104, 41]]},
    {"op": "ldev_foundation", "occupant": 80, "expect": 71, "note": "building -> kind 1"},
    {"op": "ldev_foundation", "occupant": 81, "expect": 72, "note": "prop -> kind 3"},
    {"op": "ldev_foundation", "occupant": 82, "expect": 73, "note": "other type -> kind 4"},
    {"op": "ldev_occ", "id": 81, "position": [60, 100, 40]},
    {"op": "ldev_foundation", "occupant": 81, "expect": null, "note": "line at x = 59.95: outside the kind-3 box"},

    {"op": "ldev_remove_foundation", "position": [120, 120], "kind": 2, "expect": true},
    {"op": "ldev_expect_events", "events": [{"event": "remove_occupant", "occ": 70, "a": 1, "flags": 0}]},
    {"op": "ldev_expect_occ", "id": 70, "exists": false},
    {"op": "ldev_expect_lot", "lot": 1, "flags": 0},
    {"op": "ldev_lot", "id": 1, "flags": 7},
    {"op": "ldev_remove_foundation", "position": [120, 120], "kind": 2, "expect": false},
    {"op": "ldev_expect_events", "events": []},
    {"op": "ldev_expect_lot", "lot": 1, "flags": 4, "note": "flags & ~3 whether or not a foundation was found"},
    {"op": "ldev_lot", "id": 1, "flags": 7},
    {"op": "ldev_remove_foundation", "position": [120, 120], "kind": 1, "expect": false},
    {"op": "ldev_expect_lot", "lot": 1, "flags": 7, "note": "only kind 2 touches the lot's flags"},

    {"op": "ldev_occ", "id": 74, "foundation_kind": 2, "cells": [6, 6, 7, 7], "bbox": [[100, 90, 100], [132, 110, 132]]},
    {"op": "ldev_remove_foundation", "cell": [7, 6], "expect": true},
    {"op": "ldev_expect_events", "events": [{"event": "remove_occupant", "occ": 74, "a": 1, "flags": 0}]},
    {"op": "ldev_expect_lot", "lot": 1, "flags": 4},
    {"op": "ldev_remove_foundation", "cell": [7, 6], "expect": false},

    {"op": "ldev_remove_foundation", "occupant": 80, "expect": true, "note": "slot 60: slot 52(1, 40, 40)"},
    {"op": "ldev_expect_events", "events": [{"event": "remove_occupant", "occ": 71, "a": 1, "flags": 0}]},
    {"op": "ldev_expect_occ", "id": 72, "exists": true},
    {"op": "ldev_remove_foundation", "occupant": 80, "expect": false}
  ]
}
